{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those "}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "نَصِيبٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a share"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "كَسَبُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "they earned"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "and Allah"}, {"text": "سَرِيعُ", "translation": "(is) swift"}, {"text": "ٱلْحِسَابِ", "translation": "(in taking) account"}], "sahih": "Those will have a share of what they have earned, and Allāh is swift in account."}